    "name": "Dungeon Mori",
    "steam_appid": 3597590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/5c11cb6f2c2a00ca30b5e58b03c4754b.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/5c11cb6f2c2a00ca30b5e58b03c4754b.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dungeons, find loot, customize your character and face monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/619b1f53c520e8beb90aea097d47cba4.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where monsters were banished long ago, <i>something</i> has caused them to reemerge, and it's up to you, <strong>the Hero</strong>, to rid the world of monsters and defeat the <strong>Great Eternal Dragon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Mori</strong> is a game inspired by the classic <i>Dungeon Crawlers</i> and\u00a0<i>Old School</i>\u00a0<i>RPGs</i>. With a simple, yet addicting gameplay, it features a turn based battle system combined with a choice based dungeon exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/eb73bcb48a395494d556505294aa3718.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a40f8ddfb0cc34c28f8ec4c1d788537a.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=408 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a40f8ddfb0cc34c28f8ec4c1d788537a.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a40f8ddfb0cc34c28f8ec4c1d788537a.mp4?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve inside the Dungeons to find riches and loot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeons to the end and fight a boss, or leave early to secure your earned rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>10 different dungeons</strong> to discover and explore, who knows what will you find inside them?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/fd165f205e9af667a103d6db86d1849c.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/bf305c8354f1a998e0ed5ac71c6f9cff.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=408 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/bf305c8354f1a998e0ed5ac71c6f9cff.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/bf305c8354f1a998e0ed5ac71c6f9cff.mp4?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Battle plethora of monsters, with each dungeon having their distinct variety!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 50 unique enemies</strong>, each one featuring their own lore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete <strong>Bestiary</strong> with useful information about the monsters, can you find and catalogue all of them?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a38693aae1015c248eb3adb40e7e04aa.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/6597c5d840e0d40a53bd609585f148c3.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=408 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/6597c5d840e0d40a53bd609585f148c3.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/6597c5d840e0d40a53bd609585f148c3.mp4?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character appearance!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>9\u00a0classes</strong> and <strong>7 different races</strong> to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire <strong>rare gear</strong> and equip your character with <strong>powerful weapons</strong> or show your sense of fashion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your <strong>pet</strong> and take him to assist you in battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/f259651f1676eb4d3422959d23da4c72.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/f259651f1676eb4d3422959d23da4c72.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who knows what awaits in your adventure? <strong>Enter the dungeons and find out!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/5c11cb6f2c2a00ca30b5e58b03c4754b.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/5c11cb6f2c2a00ca30b5e58b03c4754b.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Dungeons, find loot, customize your character and face monsters!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/619b1f53c520e8beb90aea097d47cba4.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where monsters were banished long ago, <i>something</i> has caused them to reemerge, and it's up to you, <strong>the Hero</strong>, to rid the world of monsters and defeat the <strong>Great Eternal Dragon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Mori</strong> is a game inspired by the classic <i>Dungeon Crawlers</i> and\u00a0<i>Old School</i>\u00a0<i>RPGs</i>. With a simple, yet addicting gameplay, it features a turn based battle system combined with a choice based dungeon exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/eb73bcb48a395494d556505294aa3718.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a40f8ddfb0cc34c28f8ec4c1d788537a.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=408 height=306 ><source 