ion about the monsters, can you find and catalogue all of them?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/a38693aae1015c248eb3adb40e7e04aa.webp?t=1754858825\" width=600 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/6597c5d840e0d40a53bd609585f148c3.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" width=408 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/6597c5d840e0d40a53bd609585f148c3.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/6597c5d840e0d40a53bd609585f148c3.mp4?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your character appearance!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>9\u00a0classes</strong> and <strong>7 different races</strong> to choose from!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire <strong>rare gear</strong> and equip your character with <strong>powerful weapons</strong> or show your sense of fashion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip your <strong>pet</strong> and take him to assist you in battle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/f259651f1676eb4d3422959d23da4c72.poster.avif?t=1754858825\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597590/extras/f259651f1676eb4d3422959d23da4c72.webm?t=1754858825\" type=\"video/webm; code